# RunicAI Getting Started

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:runic_ai, path: ".."}
])
```

## A Deterministic Model Client

```elixir
fake_client = fn _model, _prompt, _opts ->
  result =
    RunicAI.LLM.Result.new!(
      RunicAI.Message.new!(:assistant, "hello from Livebook"),
      finish_reason: :stop
    )

  {:ok, result}
end
```

## Generate Text

```elixir
{:ok, result} =
  RunicAI.LLM.generate_text(
    "test:model",
    "Say hello",
    client: fake_client
  )

RunicAI.LLM.Result.text(result)
```

## Run The Chat Recipe

```elixir
require Runic

alias Runic.Workflow
alias RunicAI.Recipes.ChatAgentKernel

workflow =
  ChatAgentKernel.new(
    model: "test:model",
    system: "You are concise.",
    client: fake_client
  )
  |> Workflow.react_until_satisfied(%{user: "Say hello."})

ChatAgentKernel.latest_reply_text(workflow)
```
